<title>UK: Commerzbank sets warrants on Dem/stg.</title>
<headline>Commerzbank sets warrants on Dem/stg.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Commerzbank AG said it has issued 80 million American-style call and put warrants, in eight equal tranches, on the mark/sterling.</p>
<p>COMMON TERMS:</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 07.NOV.96-10.SEP.97   PAYDATE	31.OCT.96</p>
<p> LISTING	   FFRT, DUSS</p>
<p>+ + + + + + + + +</p>
<p> WARRANT	  STRIKE	 PRICE</p>
<p> CALL	     2.40 DEM     5.19 DEM</p>
<p> CALL	     2.45 DEM     3.06 DEM</p>
<p> CALL	     2.50 DEM     1.79 DEM</p>
<p> CALL	     2.55 DEM     1.01 DEM</p>
<p> PUT		2.35 DEM     4.57 DEM</p>
<p> PUT		2.40 DEM     7.17 DEM</p>
<p> PUT		2.45 DEM     10.40 DEM</p>
<p> PUT		2.50 DEM     14.29 DEM</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
